  "schema:name": "Census 2021, G33 Total household income (weekly) by household composition, Remoteness Areas (RA)",
  "schema:description": "Dataset: C21_G33_RA. Total household income (weekly) by household composition data for Remoteness Areas (RA), 2021 Census, Count of occupied private dwellings. This table is based on place of enumeration. Excludes 'Visitors only' and 'Other non-classifiable' households. Please note that there are small random adjustments made to all cell values to protect the confidentiality of data. These adjustments may cause the sum of rows or columns to differ by small amounts from table totals.",
